# WHAT VERCEL MUST NOT SERVE.
#
# Everything in the repo root is served as a static file by default, so a file
# being unreferenced is NOT the same as it being private -- it just means
# nobody has found the URL yet.
#
# archive_merged.json is the signal archive: 62KB of rows carrying grade,
# entry_ref, sl, target_1 and target_2. Nothing links to it, and it was
# readable at /archive_merged.json by anyone who guessed the name. The route is
# hidden here rather than the file deleted, exactly as instructed -- it stays
# in git and in history, it simply stops being published.
archive_merged.json
outcomes.json

